<title>USA: Manitowoc approves stock split.</title>
<headline>Manitowoc approves stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MANITOWOC, Wisc. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manitowoc Co Inc said Monday it approved a three-for-two common share split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said it will distribute the dividend in the form of additional shares to holders of record June 2.</p>
<p>The company said it would arrange for issuance of these shares beginning June 30.</p>
<p>The split will increase the number of outstanding shares from about 11.5 million to about 17.3 million, the company said.</p>
</text>
